-- Hardcore - Oh, the Places You'll Go (611, Prestige 612) requires looting Overcooked Chain Links 421531 before
-- level 15, but the item had no item_template row and nothing dropped it, so the trial could not be completed.
-- Item: every client-side field from the Conquest of Azeroth item cache (itemcache.tsv, mode conquest-of-azeroth,
-- captured 2026-09-04), matching the client Item.dbc record (class 15, subclass 0, display 28501); BuyCount,
-- spell PPM rates, ScriptName, DisenchantID, FoodType, money loot and flagsCustom keep the table defaults.
-- Drop: Pyrewood Armorer 3528 at 100%, as the Exiles DB offline mirror of db.exil.es lists it (the only source
-- naming a drop for this item); no loot condition, like the Armorer's 100% Banded Buckler. The Armorer's one spawn
-- turns into Moonrage Armorer 3529 by SmartAI, and the human form is friendly to the Alliance, so Alliance
-- characters can only kill the worgen form, which on Ascension does not drop the item (issue #9053). By the
-- contributor's decision the Moonrage Armorer drops it at 100% as well, so the trial can be completed by both
-- factions.
